{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_1_values_and_coercion_08_type_coercion_toprimitive", "label": "ToPrimitive coercion", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-1-values-and-coercion/08-type-coercion.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Hint string: toString then valueOf. number/default: valueOf then toString. Symbol.toPrimitive overrides."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_1_values_and_coercion_08_type_coercion_tonumber", "label": "ToNumber", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-1-values-and-coercion/08-type-coercion.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "null becomes 0; undefined becomes NaN. A null price silently becomes free; a missing value becomes NaN and poisons later arithmetic."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_1_values_and_coercion_08_type_coercion_plus_concatenation", "label": "+ concatenates if either side is a string", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-1-values-and-coercion/08-type-coercion.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "After ToPrimitive, if either operand is a string, + concatenates. Every other arithmetic operator ToNumbers both. Form values are always strings."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_1_values_and_coercion_08_type_coercion_empty_block_plus_array", "label": "{} + [] statement parse", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-1-values-and-coercion/08-type-coercion.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "As a statement {} is an empty block, leaving unary +[] which is ToNumber('') = 0. In expression position it is concatenation."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_javascri